:: Pirate Punishment Figurehead Ask
<<effects>>
<<speechresolve>>

<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek")>>
	"P-Please help me. Don't just look."
	Your voice carries thinly over the water, frightened enough that a few of the watchers laugh before you finish.
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "shy" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile")>>
	"P-Please," you call, unable to look straight at the rail. "Help me. Don't just look."
	You try to hide your face from the cameras, but the rope keeps you pinned where they can all see.
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"Please, help me. I am not here by choice."
	You keep your chin up as best you can. The cameras turn your fright into another pretty picture.
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	"Quit staring and help. Or are you as bad as these pirates?"
	You throw the words at the nearest faces, sharp enough that a few of them stop smiling.
<<else>>
	"자발적으로 여기 있는 게 아니에요." 당신이 말한다. "내려주세요."
<</if>>
<br><br>

"들었나?" 제퍼가 말한다. "우리의 '희생자'가 도움을 애원하는군!" <<He>>【이가】 박수를 치기 시작한다. 해적들이 동참하고, 이어서 다른 배의 군중도 박수를 친다.
<br><br>

You feel Zephyr's breath on your ear. "They don't want to believe anything so inconvenient," <<he>> says. "You can't help but play along."
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Pirate Punish Figurehead 3]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Pirate Punishment Figurehead Glare
<<effects>>
<<speechresolve>>

<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	You glare at the crowd on the ship opposite. They boo you in response. It is more hurt than threat, but you refuse to smile for them.
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	You glare at the crowd on the ship opposite. They boo you in response. You give them no pretty face, no grateful blush, and nothing fit for their cameras.
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	You glare at the crowd on the ship opposite. They boo you in response. Let them boo. It only sharpens the look you give them.
<<else>>
	You glare at the crowd on the ship opposite. They boo you in response. But you hold your face steady.
<</if>>
<br><br>
You hear Zephyr's laughter, but not through the megaphone.
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Pirate Punish Figurehead 3]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Pirate Punishment Figurehead Away
<<effects>>
<<speechresolve>>

<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile")>>
	You look away from the crowd on the boat opposite, hoping to shield your face at least. It feels safer to give them no more than you have to.
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident")>>
	You look away from the crowd on the boat opposite, hoping to shield your face at least. If they want a show, they can choke on the empty view.
<<else>>
	You look away from the crowd on the boat opposite, hoping to shield your face at least. You give them the side of your face and nothing more.
